WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.137
Fatahaaddu waxay daacuunka gaarsiin kartaa ceelasha iyo haamaha biyaha.

2
00:00:04.137 --> 00:00:06.678
Daacuunku wuxuu ku faafaa biyo iyo cunto wasakh ah,

3
00:00:06.678 --> 00:00:08.870
wuxuuna dili karaa dhowr saacadood gudahood.

4
00:00:08.870 --> 00:00:11.610
Laakiin waa laga hortagi karaa, waana la daaweyn karaa.

5
00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:13.752
Waa kan sida aad u ilaalin karto qoyskaaga.

6
00:00:14.652 --> 00:00:18.228
Jeermiska daacuunku wuxuu ku nool yahay saxarada dadka uu ku dhacay.

7
00:00:18.228 --> 00:00:21.803
Marka biyaha fatahaadda ama musqulaha buuxsamay ay gaaraan ceelasha,

8
00:00:21.803 --> 00:00:23.959
haamaha iyo cuntada, jeermisku wuu galaa.

9
00:00:23.959 --> 00:00:27.114
Inta badan dadka liqa waxay yeeshaan xanuun fudud ama midna,

10
00:00:27.114 --> 00:00:28.744
laakiin weli way faafin karaan.

11
00:00:28.744 --> 00:00:33.108
Qaar baa aad u xanuunsada, oo waxaa ku dhaca shuban biyo ah oo degdeg ah iyo matag.

12
00:00:34.008 --> 00:00:36.576
Marka hore, biyaha la cabbo ka dhig kuwo nadiif ah.

13
00:00:36.576 --> 00:00:40.705
Biyaha karkari ilaa ay si xoog leh u karkaraan, oo ay ka soo baxaan xumbo waaweyn,

14
00:00:40.705 --> 00:00:42.569
kadibna ha qaboobaan iyagoo daboolan.

15
00:00:42.569 --> 00:00:43.979
Haddii aadan karkarin karin,

16
00:00:43.979 --> 00:00:47.101
isticmaal kiniinnada nadiifinta biyaha sida baakadda ku qoran.

17
00:00:47.101 --> 00:00:50.928
Biyo nadiif ah u isticmaal cabbitaanka, karinta, cadayga iyo cuntada ilmaha.

18
00:00:51.828 --> 00:00:54.958
Biyaha nadiifka ah ku kaydi weel nadiif ah oo dabool leh.

19
00:00:54.958 --> 00:00:56.826
Ka shub, ama ka isticmaal tuubada.

20
00:00:56.826 --> 00:01:00.780
Weligaa gacantaada, ama koob wasakh ah, ha ku dhex galin biyaha kaydsan.

21
00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:05.149
Marka labaad, gacmaha ku dhaq saabuun iyo biyo nadiif ah.

22
00:01:05.149 --> 00:01:06.915
Gacmaha qoy, oo saabuun mari.

23
00:01:06.915 --> 00:01:09.715
Xoq meel kasta: calaacalaha, dhabarka gacmaha,

24
00:01:09.715 --> 00:01:12.210
faraha dhexdooda iyo ciddiyaha hoostooda.

25
00:01:12.210 --> 00:01:14.645
Biyo ku maydh, oo ha ku engegaan hawada.

26
00:01:14.645 --> 00:01:19.514
Samee marka aad musqusha ka soo baxdo, marka aad ilmo nadiifiso, ka hor karinta,

27
00:01:19.514 --> 00:01:21.888
iyo ka hor cunista ama quudinta ilmaha.

28
00:01:22.788 --> 00:01:25.343
Marka saddexaad, saxarada ka fogee biyaha.

29
00:01:25.343 --> 00:01:29.235
Mar walba isticmaal musqul, weligaa dhul bannaan ha isticmaalin,

30
00:01:29.235 --> 00:01:31.060
musqulahana ka fogee ceelasha.

31
00:01:31.060 --> 00:01:35.196
Saxarada carruurta sidoo kale ku rid musqusha, kadibna gacmaha dhaq.

32
00:01:36.096 --> 00:01:38.883
Marka afraad, cuntada ka dhig mid nadiif ah.

33
00:01:38.883 --> 00:01:41.797
Cuntada si fiican u kari, oo cun iyadoo kulul.

34
00:01:41.797 --> 00:01:45.408
Midhaha ku dhaq biyo nadiif ah oo diir, cuntadana dabool.

35
00:01:46.308 --> 00:01:50.002
Haddii qof qabo shuban biyo ah, si degdeg ah u dhaqaaq.

36
00:01:50.002 --> 00:01:51.748
Isla markiiba bilow ORS.

37
00:01:51.748 --> 00:01:55.509
Hal baakad ku qas biyo nadiif ah sida baakadda ku qoran,

38
00:01:55.509 --> 00:01:57.725
oo sii qurub yar yar marar badan.

39
00:01:57.725 --> 00:02:03.030
Si degdeg ah u tag xarun caafimaad, gaar ahaan haddii qofku aad u daciif yahay,

40
00:02:03.030 --> 00:02:05.784
uusan cabbi karin, ama uu yahay ilmo yar.

41
00:02:05.784 --> 00:02:09.276
Dadka badankoodu waxay ku bogsadaan ORS degdeg ah.

42
00:02:10.176 --> 00:02:15.153
Meesha shaqaalaha caafimaadku ku bixiyaan tallaalka daacuunka ee afka laga qaato,

43
00:02:15.153 --> 00:02:18.656
qaado, oo sii wad karkarinta biyaha iyo dhaqidda gacmaha.

44
00:02:18.656 --> 00:02:21.667
Biyo nadiif ah, gacmo nadiif ah, ORS degdeg ah.

45
00:02:21.667 --> 00:02:22.896
La wadaag qoyskaaga.
